<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31049" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nĭvĕus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>from snow, snowy, snow-</i> (<b>poet.</b>) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aggeribus niveis informis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 3, 354</span></i>
			: aqua, 
			
			<i>cooled with snow</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart. 12,
				17, 6</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 14, 104</span></i> and 117: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mons,</span>”
				<i>covered with snow</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					64, 240</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>snow-white,
			snowy</i> (mostly <b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">a similitudine sic: Corpore niveum candorem,
					aspectu igneum ardorem assequebatur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Auct. Her. 4, 33, 44</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lacerti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 8, 387</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lac,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. E.
					2, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hanc si capite niveae agnae exorari judicas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 2, 36</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Briseis niveo colore,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 2, 4, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 10, 432</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">candidior nivei folio, Galatea, ligustri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 13, 789</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. H.
					18, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quā notam duxit niveus videri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 4, 2, 59</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">panis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv. 5,
					70</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flumen,</span>”
				<i>clear, pellucid</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Hippol. 504</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. 7, 32, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tribuni,</span>”
				<i>clothed in white togas</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Calp.
					Ecl. 7, 29</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Quirites,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					10, 45</span></i>
			.</div>
